    "blurb": "I live near the city as well as work within the city proper and greater metro area. You can fly in direct in Logan, drive in on interstates 90, 93, or 95 (metro), or take a train (Massachusetts Bay Transportation Authority, & Amtrak). The MBTA has a system of trains to nearby cities & towns such as Worcester, &…",
